<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT STARTS PLN 30 MLN CP BORROWING.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT STARTS PLN 30 MLN CP BORROWING.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel trader and maker Stalexport SA said on Friday it had signed an agreement with Bank Slaski under which the bank would arrange the firm's 30-million-zloty commercial paper borrowing.</p>
<p>Stalexport said in a statement that the one-year programme would allow the company to change the structure of its financing and help reduce its financial costs.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
